      "message": "fix: handle missing 'preview' column in older Codex state_5.sqlite\n\nThe  column was added to the Codex CLI threads table in a recent\nupdate. Older local databases lack this column, causing\n when the dashboard\nqueries Codex data.\n\nFix:\n- Try querying with  column first\n- On  about missing column, retry without it\n- Use  check for safe  access in title fallback\n\nCloses #29",
